{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4bdd6166-cea7-4d27-84a1-117560b91160",
    "name": "Honnoi Partner Web Backoffice",
    "description": "API collection for honnoi-partner-web-backoffice.\n\nMost POST bodies are AES-256-CBC encrypted into `{ \"payload\": \"<base64>\" }` before they reach the server (same convention as honnoi-account / honnoi-web-backoffice). The collection-level pre-request script auto-encrypts any plain JSON raw body using the `aesKey` / `aesIv` collection variables (same values as SECRETMANAGER_ID_AES_KEY / SECRETMANAGER_ID_AES_IV), EXCEPT `/auth/2fa/send-otp` and `/auth/2fa/verify`, which take plain JSON (they're guarded by the short-lived `pendingToken` JWT instead).\n\nFlow: `auth/login_bo_user` (staff) -> `partner_user/createPartnerUser` -> `auth/login` (partner) -> if `twofa_required`, `auth/2fa/send-otp` + `auth/2fa/verify` -> `partnerToken` is captured automatically into the collection variable and reused by the 2FA self-enrollment and partner self-service folders.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "12270992",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/12270992-4bdd6166-cea7-4d27-84a1-117560b91160?source=collection_link"
  },
